<view class="page"><view class="connection-error" wx:if="{{connectionError}}">{{connectionError}}</view><view class="device-hero"><view class="device-title">把药盒连回家</view><view class="device-sub">硬件还在准备，也可以先把软件用起来。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="detail-row"><text>当前状态</text><text>{{deviceLabel}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>设备编号</text><text selectable>{{device.code}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>最后通信</text><text>{{device.lastHardwareSeen || '等待首次心跳'}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>电量</text><text>{{device.battery == null ? '等待设备上报' : device.battery + '%'}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><text class="code" selectable>GET /api/device/schedule
POST /api/device/heartbeat
POST /api/device/events</text><view class="device-note">每 30 秒上报心跳，超过 90 秒无通信显示离线。软件模拟不会改变真实设备状态。设备使用独立密钥，与家属登录分开。</view><view class="device-note">当前服务：{{baseURL}}
真机联调：运行局域网启动脚本，在登录页连接设置中填写电脑局域网地址。</view></view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="generateKey">生成 / 更换设备接入密钥</button><view class="card" wx:if="{{deviceToken}}"><view class="device-note">仅显示一次，请妥善保存。离开本页后清除显示。</view><text class="code" selectable>{{deviceToken}}</text><button class="secondary-btn" bindtap="copyKey">复制密钥</button></view><view class="device-note">硬件上传事件时携带唯一 eventId 和带时区的 occurredAt。网络重试不会重复记录。详细协议见项目文档。</view></view>
